  "ruleText": "Env-A 2901.03 References. For the purpose of this chapter, unless otherwise specified all references to 40 CFR 72 and 40 CFR 75 shall be to the July 1, 2019 edition.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
